Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 07:31:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/20] dmaengine: dw: APM821xx performance rework (from the
 4.19 series)

The dw-dma driver of the 4.19 p22 series (APM821xx rework, 8K blocks)
moved to 5.10, adapted to the 5.10 dw headers (no is_private, is_memcpy,
is_idma32 in the platform data).
